000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.    TDCRRESP.
000400 INSTALLATION.  GOODYEAR TIRE & RUBBER COMPANY.
000700*REMARKS.       THIS PROGRAM SHOWS THE NUMBER OF WORK ORDERS
000800*               THAT HAVE BEEN INITIATED, STARTED, AND COM -
000900*               LETED BY SHIFT WITHIN CRAFT WITHIN ZONE.
001000*
001100*               DEFAULTS TO LAST 24 HOURS.   USER CAN SUPPLY
001200*               REPORT OPTIONS WHEN SUBMITTED BY 'XRSCREEN'.
001300*
001400 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001500 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
001600 SOURCE-COMPUTER.   AS400.
001700 OBJECT-COMPUTER.   AS400.
       COPY SPECIALN IN COPYLIB.
002000 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
002100 FILE-CONTROL.
002300     SELECT R4FILE
002400         ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFPMR4FIL
               ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
002500         ACCESS MODE IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS R4-STATUS.
002700     SELECT PRINT-FILE ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT.
002800     SELECT SORT-FILE  ASSIGN TO DISK-SORTFILE.
           SELECT WO-BASIC-FILE
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLMM1002
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS WBF-STATUS.
           SELECT WO-LAST-NUM-USED
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFPMM0800
               ORGANIZATION IS RELATIVE
               ACCESS MODE IS RANDOM
               RELATIVE KEY IS ARG-NO
               FILE STATUS IS WLNU-STATUS.
