058500
058600     IF RECD-NUM = "Y"
058700         MOVE DATE-RECD-DD      TO GREG-DD
058800         MOVE DATE-RECD-MM      TO GREG-MM
058900         MOVE DATE-RECD-YY      TO GREG-YY
               MOVE SPACES            TO JULIAN-DATE
               IF GREG-YY > "70"
                   MOVE "19"          TO GREG-CC
                   CALL "JULGREG" USING GREG-DATE, JULIAN-DATE,
                                    DAY-DIGIT, LEAP-YEAR-FLAG
                   MOVE JULIAN-DATE-9 TO JUL-DAY-RECD
               ELSE
               MOVE "20"              TO GREG-CC
059100         CALL "JULGREG" USING GREG-DATE, JULIAN-DATE,
                                DAY-DIGIT, LEAP-YEAR-FLAG
059200         MOVE JULIAN-DATE-9     TO JUL-DAY-RECD.
059300
