059500         MOVE DATE-STRT-DD      TO GREG-DD
059600         MOVE DATE-STRT-MM      TO GREG-MM
059700         MOVE DATE-STRT-YY      TO GREG-YY
               MOVE SPACES            TO JULIAN-DATE
               IF GREG-YY > "70"
                   MOVE "19"          TO GREG-CC
                   CALL "JULGREG" USING GREG-DATE, JULIAN-DATE,
