084000     MOVE SHFT-SORT TO SHFT-TAG.
084100     MOVE PRTY-SORT TO PRTY-TAG.
084200
084400 INTL-SUM.
084500     MOVE 0 TO CALLS-RECD CALLS-STRT   CALLS-COMP CALLS-NOT-STRT
084600               CALLS-NOT-COMP   CALLS-NET-RECD    CALLS-NET-STRT
084700               CALLS-AVG-RESP CALLS-AVG-WORK RESP-CNTR WORK-CNTR
084800               RESP-TOTAL WORK-TOTAL.
084900
085100 PRNT-REC.
085200     COMPUTE CALLS-NOT-STRT = CALLS-RECD - CALLS-STRT.
085300     IF CALLS-NOT-STRT <  0  MOVE 0 TO CALLS-NOT-STRT.
085400     COMPUTE CALLS-NOT-COMP = CALLS-RECD - CALLS-COMP.
085500     IF CALLS-NOT-COMP <  0  MOVE 0 TO CALLS-NOT-COMP.
085600     COMPUTE CALLS-NET-RECD = CALLS-STRT - CALLS-RECD.
085700     COMPUTE CALLS-NET-STRT = CALLS-COMP - CALLS-STRT.
085800     COMPUTE CALLS-AVG-RESP = RESP-TOTAL / RESP-CNTR.
085900     COMPUTE CALLS-AVG-WORK = WORK-TOTAL / WORK-CNTR.
086100     MOVE CALLS-RECD     TO   CALLS-RECD-P.
086200     MOVE CALLS-STRT     TO   CALLS-STRT-P.
086300     MOVE CALLS-COMP     TO   CALLS-COMP-P.
086400     MOVE CALLS-NOT-STRT TO   CALLS-NOT-STRT-P.
086500     MOVE CALLS-NOT-COMP TO   CALLS-NOT-COMP-P.
086600     MOVE CALLS-NET-RECD TO   CALLS-NET-RECD-P.
086700     MOVE CALLS-NET-STRT TO   CALLS-NET-STRT-P.
086800     MOVE CALLS-AVG-RESP TO   CALLS-AVG-RESP-P.
086900     MOVE CALLS-AVG-WORK TO   CALLS-AVG-WORK-P.
087100     IF WRITE-K > 60 PERFORM HEAD-LIT.
087300     WRITE PRINTF FROM DETAIL-PRNT AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.
087400     ADD 1 TO WRITE-K.
087500     MOVE "Y" TO LAST-RECORD-PRNT-SW.
087600
